  - Convert the presented numbers into a single consistent unit (e.g., NOK million to two decimals).
  - Extract the precise notes (e.g., note 5 Business combinations, note 13 Intangible assets, note 10 finance items) in full to show acquisition accounting and purchase price adjustment detail.
  - Search for the term "discontinued" across full documents if you want confirmation whether any discontinued operations exist.

