Arguments:
	query: Extract sections reporting Revenue and Gross Profit for most recent fiscal year in prospectus and annual report, include exact numeric values, captions (reporting period), notes on adjustments/pro forma/restatements, accounting policy notes affecting revenue/gross profit, mentions of discontinued operations, acquisitions, scope changes; provide document names and section headings or page numbers.
	k: 4

